  "steps": [
    "Tray. Preheat the oven to 180 °C fan. Lay the potatoes in a large roasting tray and nestle the chicken legs on top.",
    "Marinade. Whisk the marinade ingredients in a jug until smooth and pour over everything, mixing with your hands so all is coated.",
    "Bake. Cover with foil and bake 1½ hours in total; halfway through, remove the foil and turn the chicken and potatoes.",
    "Serve. Serve immediately, with tzatziki and a mixed Greek salad if you like."
